  "description": "MSBuild integration for Adaptify.PureView.Tool. Add this package + the\ntool as a dotnet tool; Adaptify.PureView.MSBuild.targets fires before the F# compiler and\nregenerates *.g.fs for every [<PureView>] binding.",
  "id": "Adaptify.PureView.MSBuild",
