  "published": "2026-06-18T11:15:45.9Z",
  "releaseNotes": "- fix: generated code compiles on Windows. The emitter joined lines with `StringBuilder.AppendLine` (= `Environment.NewLine` = `\\r\\n` on Windows), and the tool injected the mirrored `open` lines with `code.Replace(\"open Adaptify.PureView\\n\", …)` — the `\\n` search never matched the Windows `\\r\\n`, so EVERY mirrored `open` was silently dropped and the generated file failed to compile (`Trafo3d`/`V3f`/`NodeShape` not defined). Emitter now emits `\\n` explicitly (generated code is byte-identical regardless of build OS), and the open-injection is line-based / newline-agnostic.",
  "title": "Adaptify.PureView.MSBuild",
  "verbatimVersion": "0.1.14",
